{"sections":[{"slug":"Gysin同态","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Gysin同态"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Gysin <span lang=\"zh\">同态</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Gysin 同态”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">微分几何</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X, Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧连通微分流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若映射</span> $f \\colon X \\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\nc_1(f) \\equiv  w_2(Y) -f^* w_2(X) \\mod 2\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $w_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Stiefel--Whitney类","text":"Stiefel–Whitney <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n"}]}}}]}